{"timestamp": 1783623020.533083, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I reported Alice\u2019s body in lower_engine. My route this round was electrical -> medbay -> storage -> lower_engine. I didn\u2019t see anyone along the way, so I don\u2019t have a suspect yet. Body was just sitting in lower_engine when I arrived. Everyone should give routes, especially anyone who was near storage/lower_engine."}}
{"timestamp": 1783623027.991478, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I was nowhere near lower_engine. My route was weapons -> security -> navigation. I saw Eve in security around tick 6, then later Eve was with me in navigation around ticks 10-11. I also saw Bob leave navigation toward security at tick 10. I didn\u2019t see Alice at all this round, and I didn\u2019t see anyone coming from storage or lower_engine. So from my info, Eve was on the right side with me late, and Bob was also on the right side at least at tick 10."}}
