{"timestamp": 1783623067.300799, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Bob\u2019s right that I came into storage around tick 4 from navigation. After that I was mostly around storage doing my task there, then I looped back through storage because I wasn\u2019t sure where to go next. I didn\u2019t see Alice at all, and I didn\u2019t see Frank until the report.\n\nFrom everyone\u2019s routes, Charlie/Eve/Bob all sound pretty confirmed right side for the later part, so I don\u2019t think it\u2019s any of them unless the timing is super weird. That leaves me and Frank as the only ones anywhere near that side of the map, but I didn\u2019t go into lower_engine or see the body.\n\nFrank\u2019s report could definitely be legit, but it\u2019s also the only person actually placing himself on the body. I\u2019m not hard accusing yet, but if everyone else was right side, we should seriously consider self-report versus someone passing through storage/lower_engine quickly."}}
