{"timestamp": 1783623093.7079868, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 15, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My info hasn\u2019t changed: I can hard vouch that Eve was on the right side with me late in navigation, and Bob was in navigation until tick 10 before leaving toward security. So I really don\u2019t think it\u2019s Eve or Bob based on timing, unless Alice died extremely early.\n\nThat leaves Diana and Frank. Between the two, I\u2019m leaning Diana right now because Bob saw her in storage early, and her route after that is vague \u2014 \u201cmostly around storage\u201d but Frank says he passed through storage and didn\u2019t see her. That\u2019s a mismatch that matters.\n\nFrank self-report is possible, but reporting a body in lower_engine after giving a clear route feels less suspicious to me than Diana being near the area with no one confirming her after tick 4. I\u2019d like Diana to give exact movement/timing if she can, but right now I\u2019m leaning vote Diana."}}
